. La aplicaci\u00f3n cuenta con una interfaz clara y accesible, f\u00e1cil de navegar con las gafas puestas. Crea, edita y elimina alarmas con gestos sencillos y disfruta de notificaciones visuales y sonoras claras que te garantizan que nunca te pierdas un momento importante, ya sea que est\u00e9s jugando, trabajando o relaj\u00e1ndote en RV.", "short_description": "Esta alarma tiene: Temporizador, Cron\u00f3metro y alarma de conversi\u00f3n."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "portrait.png", "id": "2905496342955542", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507823984_2905496346288875_7146297178865334511_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CKbLHeLwFCIQ7kNvwH_ikjD&_nc_oc=Adk3HCxR7DTerm-cR4R7pMXjXvjLF8BKBR6qz16zCsf5-gGzNrtH9NnqkDeB6YRW7mw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfsvmivxyDOMEnYFsxTfCb23JBn6iG6jLfPkAdjwJtcGRQ&oe=69A97EBE"}, {"file_name": "icono-512.png", "id": "2243906042732063", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618482_2243906046065396_1094352884120925797_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zk6I5w3Z82cQ7kNvwEKrcFl&_nc_oc=AdkP3BPU8Mffp131fPYihnVDeikMe0qilLFQwMZw4dglRnUR3EVgM7vdgRZFBGm1XBA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfuDXBxn_7GXwk9Gv7pltjKpQHGAGpYSnXfPEKz2F9nMGQ&oe=69A9955E"}, {"file_name": "square.png", "id": "1745867016009353", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831056_1745867019342686_1501165532938032609_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=h1E6Jkd_zZUQ7kNvwHTGbfR&_nc_oc=AdmuKL9A6v9xPgPsr-9_QiamqFlGRdAtpltGAY4Dil632YuOrEG6YpXXxnj07f497mA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfvFbCRVH1HWTHZvqxstNV5byxOUhqkPx31H-Maap9PP6w&oe=69A98ADB"}, {"file_name": "hero cover.png", "id": "1368705761087761", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1